  ('lech-zurs-austria', '01F', 'Lech-Zürs am Arlberg', 'Austria', 'The jet-set Arlberg', 'live', 'verified', 'northernLights', 'Austria', '{"ski","adventure","romance","wellness","culinary","entertainment","family"}', '{}', '{"essential","comfort","premier","luxury","ultra"}', null, 'emerging', '{"key_facts":["Lech (~1,444 m) + Zurs (~1,716 m), Vorarlberg (Bludenz district); the exclusive jet-set/royalty end of the Arlberg; Dutch royals since 1959; Best of the Alps member","Part of Ski Arlberg = Austria''s largest connected ski area (~305 km piste, ~200 km off-piste, ~85-88 lifts); linked to St. Anton via the 2016 Flexenbahn","Der Weisse Ring = 22 km ski circuit (Lech-Zurs-Oberlech, ~5,500 m altitude change), annual race since 2005/06; area top = Valluga 2,811 m","AUSTRIA''S ONLY officially permitted heli-skiing: drops on Mehlsack (experienced) + Schneetali-Orgelscharte (intermediate); departures Kriegerhorn/Flexenpass; operator Wucher Helikopter; guided-only (up to 3+guide); ~EUR 540-600/group + guide fee","~200 km freeride Eldorado; guided-only; permit reportedly limited (2.5-yr as of Jan 2022 - current renewal to verify)","Deep 5-star scene: Almhof Schneider (5* superior, since 1929), Post Lech (Relais & Chateaux 40+ yr), Aurelio + Severin*s (SLH), Hotel Arlberg, Burg Vital (~3,800 m2 spa), Loruenser (Zurs)","World Gourmet Village dining (several Michelin-Guide-LISTED hotels; independent stars/toques NOT confirmed - not asserted)","Tanzcafe Arlberg Music Festival (free concerts, since 2013, spring sun-ski weeks, Lech+Zurs+St Anton)","Season 2025/26 = 3 Dec 2025 - 19 Apr 2026 (three price periods: Wedel weeks / main season / sun-ski weeks)","Reached via Langen am Arlberg rail (~15 km) + bus/taxi over the Flexen Pass; airports Innsbruck ~120 / Friedrichshafen ~130 / Zurich ~190 / Munich ~230 km","Oberlech is largely car-free / ski-in-ski-out - a traffic-reduced luxury base above Lech","St. Anton am Arlberg is a DISTINCT village/dossier on the SAME connected Ski Arlberg network (overlap flagged, not merged); St. Anton = Tirol, Lech-Zurs = Vorarlberg","Arlberg is high-avalanche terrain - the Jan 2019 Lange Zug piste avalanche killed 4 skiers","Nearest hospital = Landeskrankenhaus Bludenz (~30 km / ~40 min via the Flexen Pass)","Heli departs Kriegerhorn + Flexenpass; ~250 flights / ~1,000 participants per winter (environmentally controversial; permit limited)","Small permanent populations (Lech ~1,568, Zurs ~154) give a quiet, high-end village feel very unlike the party resorts"],"safety":{"emergency":"112 EU general / 140 Bergrettung alpine rescue / 144 ambulance / 133 police / 122 fire","hospital":"Landeskrankenhaus Bludenz (LKH Bludenz) ~30 km / ~40 min via Flexen Pass; 140 Bergrettung / helicopter alpine evac","advisory_level":"L1","malaria":"none","yellow_fever":"not required","activity_note":"High-avalanche freeride + heli terrain (Jan 2019 Lange Zug avalanche killed 4) - avalanche is the killer: Lawinenwarndienst Vorarlberg (warnung.vorarlberg.at), EAWS 5-level; transceiver/airbag/probe/shovel + qualified guide off-piste AND heli (guided-only); NOT Lawinenwarndienst Tirol (that''s the St. Anton side), NOT SLF; rescue 140 Bergrettung"},"timing":{"peak":"High winter — Christmas/NY, Feb half-terms (priciest main season) — skiing + freeride + five-star; heli slots + top suites book earliest","shoulder":"Early Dec Wedel-week value + spring sun-ski weeks (long days, high snow, Tanzcafe Arlberg festival)","green":"May-Jun + Oct-Nov (primarily a winter resort — many lifts/hotels closed; verify)","booking_lead":"Christmas/NY + Feb + top five-stars/suites + heli slots 4-9 mo; regular winter 2-4 mo; spring/festival 2-4 mo","off_season_specials":"Spring sun-ski + Tanzcafe Arlberg festival; Wedel-week Dec value; luxury-wellness stays","event_peaks":"Ski holidays (Dec-Apr), Der Weisse Ring race (mid-Jan), Tanzcafe Arlberg (spring), Christmas/NY","campaign_start":"Next winter + heli + top chalets/suites by Jun-Aug; spring sun-ski + fest